  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like symbol of death, except that all creatures within 60 feet of the symbol of fear instead become panicked for 1 round per caster level.\n\nNote: Magic traps such as symbol of fear are hard to detect and disable. A rogue (only) can use the Perception skill to find a symbol of fear and Disable Device to thwart it. The DC in each case is 25 + spell level, or 31 for symbol of fear.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell functions like symbol of death, except that all creatures within 60 feet of the symbol of fear instead become panicked for 1 round per caster level.\\n\\nnote: magic traps such as symbol of fear are hard to detect and disable. a rogue (only) can use the perception skill to find a symbol of fear and disable device to thwart it. the dc in each case is 25 + spell level, or 31 for symbol of fear.\"",
    "sections": []
  },
